{
 "encounter_id": "00722",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hiya. I've got a swollen gland in my neck, it's been three weeks, my mate Dean says it's glandular fever but he thinks everything's glandular fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which side?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The left, under the jaw. Size of a grape. Hurts if I press it, which I do, constantly, in the mirror."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything before it came up?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A sore throat, about a week, then it settled. Nothing since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any earache or a blocked nose?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Earache on the left, on and off, and my nose is blocked half the time, but that's the hay fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any night sweats?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No sweats, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None, I'm the same as ever, sadly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble swallowing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I eat like a horse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hoarseness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Nope, my voice is the same. Ask my sister, she'd tell you."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cetirizine, 10 mg, once a day, for the hay fever. And omeprazole, 20 mg, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. I came out in a rash when I was about ten."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else in your history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The reflux, the hay fever, and eczema on my hands."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tonsils out when I was twelve."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Illnesses in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mum's got a thyroid problem."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About five a day, I know, I know."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Couple of glasses of wine at the weekend."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a hairdresser, so I'm in people's faces all day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me examine you. Pulse 68, blood pressure 118 over 72, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14, weight 64 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All normal then? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "All normal. Chin up for me. I can feel a single firm lymph node under the left jaw, about two centimetres, tender and mobile.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's the one. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your throat looks a little red but there's no swelling of the tonsils, and I can't feel any other lumps in the neck."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So it's not serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble breathing, a cough, anything on the chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, chest's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This looks like a reactive lymph node after the throat infection. They can stay up for weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Should I be worried? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I don't think so, but I'd like to arrange blood tests including a full blood count, and an ultrasound scan of the neck."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And what about the chest thing? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to do a chest X-ray too, as you smoke."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fair enough. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks to see whether it's gone down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Brilliant, ta. ~"
  }
 ],
